# The skarnet.org packages uinitconverter runs on, in build order. This is the only
# place their versions live: dist/rpm/build-skarnet-rpms.sh (the RPM specs)
# reads it, and builds them in this order.
#
# To move to new releases, change the versions and checksums here. The
# checksum is skarnet.org's published one:
#   curl https://skarnet.org/software/NAME/NAME-VERSION.tar.gz.sha256
#
# name          version     sha256 of NAME-VERSION.tar.gz
